    {
      "type": "text", "id": "d1_sub", "x": 40, "y": 74, "width": 1120, "height": 22,
      "text": "Install once → discover work → build it through a reviewed pipeline → keep it healthy.  You steer with plain-English decisions; it does the engineering.",
